      "accessibleParagraph": {
        "value": "{ $state ->\n   [openToInsideEmpty] 等待钠，向内开放\n   [openToInsideSodiumBound] 3 个钠已结合，等待磷酸盐，向内开放\n   [openToInsideSodiumAndATPBound] ATP 反应，磷酸盐结合，将 3 个钠泵出，向内开放\n   [openToInsideSodiumAndPhosphateBound] 磷酸盐结合，将 3 个钠泵出，向内开放\n   [openToOutsideAwaitingPotassium] 磷酸盐结合，等待钾，向外开放\n   [openToOutsidePotassiumBound] 磷酸盐漂走，将 2 个钾泵入，向外开放\n\n   [openToOutsideAwaitingParticles] { $warning ->\n     [shown] 警告，外部钠浓度过低无法结合，向外开放\n     *[hidden] 等待钠和葡萄糖，向外开放\n   }\n   [openToOutsideAllParticlesBound] 钠和葡萄糖已结合，向外开放\n   [openToInside] 将 2 个钠和 1 个葡萄糖泵入，向内开放\n\n   [ligandBoundClosed] { $proteinType ->\n     [sodiumIonLigandGatedChannel] 三角形配体结合，通道打开\n     *[potassiumIonLigandGatedChannel] 星形配体结合，通道打开\n   }\n   [ligandBoundOpen] { $proteinType ->\n     [sodiumIonLigandGatedChannel] 通道打开，绑定了三角形配体\n     *[potassiumIonLigandGatedChannel] 通道打开，绑定了星形配体\n   }\n   [ligandUnboundOpen] { $proteinType ->\n     [sodiumIonLigandGatedChannel] 三角形配体漂走，通道关闭\n     *[potassiumIonLigandGatedChannel] 星形配体漂走，通道关闭\n   }\n   [closed] { $proteinType ->\n     [sodiumIonLigandGatedChannel] 通道关闭，无三角形配体结合\n     *[potassiumIonLigandGatedChannel] 通道关闭，无星形配体结合\n   }\n\n   [closedNegative70mV] -70 mV 时通道关闭\n   [openNegative50mV] -50 mV 时通道开放\n   [closed30mV] 30 mV 时通道关闭\n\n   [closedNegative50mV] -50 mV 时通道关闭\n   [open30mV] 30 mV 时通道开放\n\n *[open] 通道开放\n}."
      },
      "accessibleContextResponse": {
        "value": "{ $state ->\n   [openToInsideEmpty] 磷酸盐漂走，将 2 个钾泵入\n   [openToInsideSodiumAndATPBound] ATP 反应，磷酸盐结合，将 3 个钠泵出\n\n *[openToInside] { $glucoseBehavior ->\n     [metabolized] 将 2 个钠和 1 个葡萄糖泵入，葡萄糖被代谢\n     *[persistent] 将 2 个钠和 1 个葡萄糖泵入\n   }\n\n   [ligandBoundOpen] { $proteinType ->\n     [sodiumIonLigandGatedChannel] 三角形配体结合，开放\n     *[potassiumIonLigandGatedChannel] 星形配体结合，开放\n   }\n   [closed] { $proteinType ->\n     [sodiumIonLigandGatedChannel] 三角形配体漂走，关闭\n     *[potassiumIonLigandGatedChannel] 星形配体漂走，关闭\n   }\n}."
